{"subject":"Forensic Medicine","sourceTitle":"All In One Online","title":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","deckName":"created by tele @Neet_pg_bot::dams::DAMS_Online_Test_Series_GT_SWT::CT_FMGE::FMT_Dr_Mohit","questions":[{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235160","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":1,"stem":"Hostile witness can be punished under which section","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Section 191 IPC"},{"label":"B","text":"Section 193 IPC"},{"label":"C","text":"Section 191 IEA"},{"label":"D","text":"Section 154 IEA"}],"answer":"B","answerText":"Section 193 IPC","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (B)</p>\n<p>Hostile witness is defined in 154 IEA and punished in 193 IPC</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235162","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":2,"stem":"Which amongst the following is not a type of fingerprint","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Loop"},{"label":"B","text":"Arches"},{"label":"C","text":"Composite"},{"label":"D","text":"Secondary"}],"answer":"D","answerText":"Secondary","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (D)</p>\n<p>Secondary</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235164","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":3,"stem":"Adipocere requires","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Dry and hot atmosphere"},{"label":"B","text":"Warm and moist atmosphere"},{"label":"C","text":"Only Cold atmosphere"},{"label":"D","text":"Only warm atmosphere"}],"answer":"B","answerText":"Warm and moist atmosphere","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (B)</p>\n<p>Warm and moist atmosphere</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235166","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":4,"stem":"Marbling is seen in how much time after death","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Within one day"},{"label":"B","text":"In 1 – 2 days"},{"label":"C","text":"In 3-4 days"},{"label":"D","text":"In 5-7 days"}],"answer":"B","answerText":"In 1 – 2 days","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (B)</p>\n<p>Marbling is because of SulphHemoglobin</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235168","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":5,"stem":"Abrasion, 10 cm X 8 cm over the face of a female is","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Hurt"},{"label":"B","text":"Grievous Hurt"},{"label":"C","text":"Dangerous injury"},{"label":"D","text":"All of the above"}],"answer":"A","answerText":"Hurt","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (A)</p>\n<p>Abrasion heals spontaneously without any permanent disfigurement. Dangerous injury is that which endangers life.</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235170","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":6,"stem":"Which is the most common preservative used for preserving viscera for chemical analysis","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Formalin"},{"label":"B","text":"Glycerine"},{"label":"C","text":"Sodium Chloride"},{"label":"D","text":"Sodium Fluoride"}],"answer":"C","answerText":"Sodium Chloride","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (C)</p>\n<p>Best is Rectified spirit</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235172","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":7,"stem":"Rugaescopy are prints taken from","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Palate"},{"label":"B","text":"Lips"},{"label":"C","text":"Fingers"},{"label":"D","text":"Ears"}],"answer":"A","answerText":"Palate","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (A)</p>\n<p>Palatoprints/ Rugaescopy are prints taken from palate.</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235174","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":8,"stem":"Superimposition is the technique of identification using","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Femur"},{"label":"B","text":"Skull"},{"label":"C","text":"Retina"},{"label":"D","text":"Sternum"}],"answer":"B","answerText":"Skull","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (B)</p>\n<p>Skull</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235176","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":9,"stem":"Windshield glass injury causes","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Sparrow feet appearance"},{"label":"B","text":"Whiplash injury"},{"label":"C","text":"Rabbit punch"},{"label":"D","text":"Commotio cordis"}],"answer":"A","answerText":"Sparrow feet appearance","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (A)</p>\n<p>Sparrow feet appearance</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235178","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":10,"stem":"A bullet which gets deflected after striking an object is known as","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Piggyback bullet"},{"label":"B","text":"Souvenier bullet"},{"label":"C","text":"Richochet bullet"},{"label":"D","text":"Frangible bullet"}],"answer":"C","answerText":"Richochet bullet","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (C)</p>\n<p>Frangible bullet – bullet that fragments on striking</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235180","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":11,"stem":"Which amongst the following is not a dangerous weapon","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Knife"},{"label":"B","text":"Brick"},{"label":"C","text":"Sword"},{"label":"D","text":"Rifle"}],"answer":"B","answerText":"Brick","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (B)</p>\n<p>Dangerous weapon is used for shooting, stabbing, cutting</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235182","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":12,"stem":"A doctor takes commission for referring a patient to a laboratory. This is a type of","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Dichotomy"},{"label":"B","text":"Adultery"},{"label":"C","text":"Association"},{"label":"D","text":"Therapeutic Privilege"}],"answer":"A","answerText":"Dichotomy","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (A)</p>\n<p>Splitting fees/ taking comission is Dichotomy</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235184","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":13,"stem":"A doctor leaves scissors in the abdominal cavity of a patient during laparotomy. It is what type of doctrine","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Doctrine of common knowledge"},{"label":"B","text":"Res Ipsa Loquitor"},{"label":"C","text":"Res Judicata"},{"label":"D","text":"Doctrine of anticipation"}],"answer":"B","answerText":"Res Ipsa Loquitor","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (B)</p>\n<p>Leaving scissors in abdomen during laparotomy shows negligence of doctor – Res Ipsa Loquitory</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235186","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":14,"stem":"The crown heel length of the fetus is 16 cm. What would be the age of the fetus?","options":[{"label":"A","text":"3 months"},{"label":"B","text":"4 months"},{"label":"C","text":"5 months"},{"label":"D","text":"6 months"}],"answer":"B","answerText":"4 months","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (B)</p>\n<p>Age of fetus = square root of length of fetus -&amp;gt; Haase’s rule</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235188","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":15,"stem":"What is not written in death certificate","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Mode of death"},{"label":"B","text":"Cause of death"},{"label":"C","text":"Time of death"},{"label":"D","text":"Manner of death"}],"answer":"A","answerText":"Mode of death","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (A)</p>\n<p>Mode of death</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235190","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":16,"stem":"Which is not a test for blood stain","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Teichman’s test"},{"label":"B","text":"Takayama test"},{"label":"C","text":"Acid phosphatase test"},{"label":"D","text":"Luminol test"}],"answer":"C","answerText":"Acid phosphatase test","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (C)</p>\n<p>Acid phosphatase test</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235192","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":17,"stem":"The best inquest amongst the following is","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Magistrate inquest"},{"label":"B","text":"Coroner inquest"},{"label":"C","text":"Police inquest"},{"label":"D","text":"Medical Examiners inquest"}],"answer":"D","answerText":"Medical Examiners inquest","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (D)</p>\n<p>Medical Examiners inquest</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235194","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":18,"stem":"Snake bite mark is a type of","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Pressure abrasion"},{"label":"B","text":"Puncture wound"},{"label":"C","text":"Penetrating wound"},{"label":"D","text":"Perforating wound"}],"answer":"B","answerText":"Puncture wound","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (B)</p>\n<p>Puncture wound</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235196","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":19,"stem":"A person dying of myocardial infarction due to explosion is categorized as which type of blast injury","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Primary"},{"label":"B","text":"Secondary"},{"label":"C","text":"Tertiary"},{"label":"D","text":"Quaternary"}],"answer":"D","answerText":"Quaternary","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (D)</p>\n<p>Any miscellaneous reason will be categorised as quaternary blast injury</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235198","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":20,"stem":"Suspended animation is not seen in","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Yogis"},{"label":"B","text":"Murder"},{"label":"C","text":"Drowning"},{"label":"D","text":"Electrocution"}],"answer":"B","answerText":"Murder","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (B)</p>\n<p>Suspended animation is a state of apparent death</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235200","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":21,"stem":"Haemodilution occurs in","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Sea water drowning"},{"label":"B","text":"Fresh water drowning"},{"label":"C","text":"Both sea and fresh water drowning"},{"label":"D","text":"None of the above."}],"answer":"B","answerText":"Fresh water drowning","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (B)</p>\n<p>Fresh water drowning</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235202","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":22,"stem":"Most important sign of antemortem drowning is indicated by","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Cutis anserine"},{"label":"B","text":"Frothy fluid in mouth and nostril"},{"label":"C","text":"Grass and weeds in hands"},{"label":"D","text":"Washer women hands"}],"answer":"C","answerText":"Grass and weeds in hands","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (C)</p>\n<p>It indicates Cadaveric spasm</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235204","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":23,"stem":"Most common site of injury to spinal cord in judicial hanging is in between","options":[{"label":"A","text":"C1 and C2"},{"label":"B","text":"C2 and C3"},{"label":"C","text":"C6 and C7"},{"label":"D","text":"Any of the above."}],"answer":"B","answerText":"C2 and C3","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (B)</p>\n<p>C2 and C3</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235206","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":24,"stem":"Dribbling of saliva is characteristic of","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Antemortem hanging"},{"label":"B","text":"Post-mortem hanging"},{"label":"C","text":"Homicidal strangulation"},{"label":"D","text":"Suicidal strangulation."}],"answer":"A","answerText":"Antemortem hanging","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (A)</p>\n<p>Antemortem hanging</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235208","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":25,"stem":"Le facies sympatheque is condition seen in cases of","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Hanging"},{"label":"B","text":"Strangulation"},{"label":"C","text":"Choking"},{"label":"D","text":"Gagging"}],"answer":"A","answerText":"Hanging","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (A)</p>\n<p>Hanging</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235210","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":26,"stem":"Fracture of hyoid bone with thyroid cartilage with neck muscle bruising suggests death due to","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Manual strangulation"},{"label":"B","text":"Ligature strangulation"},{"label":"C","text":"Hanging"},{"label":"D","text":"Choking"}],"answer":"A","answerText":"Manual strangulation","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (A)</p>\n<p>Manual strangulation</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235212","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":27,"stem":"Pugilistic attitudes is due to","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Lipolyses"},{"label":"B","text":"Protein coagulation"},{"label":"C","text":"Carbohydrate coagulation"},{"label":"D","text":"Increased Carbon monoxide level"}],"answer":"B","answerText":"Protein coagulation","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (B)</p>\n<p>Protein coagulation</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235214","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":28,"stem":"Arborescent marks are seen in","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Head injury"},{"label":"B","text":"Firearm wound"},{"label":"C","text":"Burns"},{"label":"D","text":"Lightening"}],"answer":"D","answerText":"Lightening","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (D)</p>\n<p>Lightening</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235216","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":29,"stem":"The feminine of impotence is","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Sterility."},{"label":"B","text":"Frigidity."},{"label":"C","text":"Nymphomania."},{"label":"D","text":"Cunnilingus."}],"answer":"B","answerText":"Frigidity.","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (B)</p>\n<p>Frigidity.</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235218","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":30,"stem":"For performing MTP consent is required from","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Husband only."},{"label":"B","text":"Both husband and wife."},{"label":"C","text":"Concerned mother."},{"label":"D","text":"Not required."}],"answer":"C","answerText":"Concerned mother.","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (C)</p>\n<p>Concerned mother.</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235220","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":31,"stem":"Irresistible sexual desire in a male is known as?","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Nymphomania"},{"label":"B","text":"Tribadism"},{"label":"C","text":"Satyriasis"},{"label":"D","text":"Sadism"}],"answer":"C","answerText":"Satyriasis","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (C)</p>\n<p>Satyriasis</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235222","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":32,"stem":"Active principle used to produce artificial bruise is:","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Abrin"},{"label":"B","text":"Bhilawanol"},{"label":"C","text":"Crotin"},{"label":"D","text":"Ricin"}],"answer":"B","answerText":"Bhilawanol","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (B)</p>\n<p>Bhilawanol</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235224","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":33,"stem":"Smell of bitter almonds is present in poisoning by:","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Prussic acid"},{"label":"B","text":"Phosphorus"},{"label":"C","text":"Oxalic acid"},{"label":"D","text":"Arsenic"}],"answer":"A","answerText":"Prussic acid","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (A)</p>\n<p>It contains cyanide</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235226","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":34,"stem":"Heavy metal poisoning cause proximal tubular necrosis:","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Mercury"},{"label":"B","text":"Arsenic"},{"label":"C","text":"Lead"},{"label":"D","text":"Gold"}],"answer":"A","answerText":"Mercury","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (A)</p>\n<p>Mercury</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235228","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":35,"stem":"Most specific test for organophosphorous poisoning is:","options":[{"label":"A","text":"RBC cholinesterase level"},{"label":"B","text":"Plasma cholinesterase level"},{"label":"C","text":"RBC uroporphyrin level"},{"label":"D","text":"Measurement of serum levels of organo¬ phosphorous"}],"answer":"A","answerText":"RBC cholinesterase level","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (A)</p>\n<p>RBC cholinesterase level</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235230","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":36,"stem":"Ophitoxaemia refers to poisoning by","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Amphibian"},{"label":"B","text":"Spider"},{"label":"C","text":"Snake"},{"label":"D","text":"Bee."}],"answer":"C","answerText":"Snake","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (C)</p>\n<p>Snake</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235232","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":37,"stem":"A 10 years old patient having history of snake bite came to the emergency department with local oedema of 3 cm at the injury site. On examination no abnormality was detected. Laboratory investigations show normal report. Now the most appropriate management is","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Intravenous anti-snake venom"},{"label":"B","text":"Incision and suction"},{"label":"C","text":"Observe further progress of patient"},{"label":"D","text":"Locally subcutaneous anti-snake venom"}],"answer":"C","answerText":"Observe further progress of patient","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (C)</p>\n<p>As there are no systemic signs of envenomation administration of anti-snake venom is not required. If the patient remains stable for 24 hrs then he may be discharged.</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235234","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":38,"stem":"Which of the following is also known as “Madak”?","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Dhatura"},{"label":"B","text":"Cannabis"},{"label":"C","text":"Opium"},{"label":"D","text":"Calotropis"}],"answer":"C","answerText":"Opium","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (C)</p>\n<p>Opium</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235236","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":39,"stem":"The most potent of all the preparations of cannabis indica is","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Majun"},{"label":"B","text":"Bhang"},{"label":"C","text":"Ganja"},{"label":"D","text":"Charas"}],"answer":"D","answerText":"Charas","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (D)</p>\n<p>Charas</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""},{"id":"all-in-one-1760436235238","topic":"DAMS · FMT Dr Mohit","number":40,"stem":"In case of strychnine poisoning","options":[{"label":"A","text":"All muscles are affected at the same time"},{"label":"B","text":"Upper limbs muscles are affected first"},{"label":"C","text":"Neck muscles are affected first"},{"label":"D","text":"Lower limbs muscles are affected first."}],"answer":"A","answerText":"All muscles are affected at the same time","solutionHtml":"<p>Correct Answer (A)</p>\n<p>This is useful to differentiate it from tetanus.</p>\n<br/><br/>","tags":""}]}